<title>CHILE: Chile Banco Edwards 9-mo net 13.8 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Chile Banco Edwards 9-mo net 13.8 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Banco de A Edwards reported net earnings of 13.75 billion pesos in the first nine months of the year, said the Superintendency of Banks and Financial Institutions.</p>
<p>The bank posted net profits of 5.7 billion pesos in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The 1995 figure was reduced by a 4.9 billion peso repayment of subordinated debt owed to the central bank. The debt was completely repaid from funds raised from a stock offering on Wall Street last year.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212</p>
</text>
